            "source:b04a61fe88ddb010006fbc03"
          ],
          "text": "Gilbarta Grandhammer is a Battleground Enthusiast who explains the Spirits of Competition and describes Alliance and Horde competitors honoring them in battlegrounds. She says she stockpiles souvenirs from those contests and describes a possible exchange tied to a secret word.",
          "when": {
            "entry": 27398
          }
